Mascotte is based on ideas and geometry from Zdog, a pseudo-3D engine.

  Project:    https://github.com/metafizzy/zdog
  Copyright:  Copyright 2020 Metafizzy
  License:    MIT (as stated in the upstream package.json and README)

Taken from Zdog: the drawing style (round strokes, a dot as a sphere, fill with
stroke), path commands and the 9/16 arc approximation, and the geometry of the
composite primitives (hemisphere, cylinder, cone, box). The engine code is written
from scratch; some formulas (surface outlines, sort points, the arc approximation)
follow Zdog's.

An unmodified copy of the Zdog core (js/ directory, upstream commit dde8684) was
kept in src/core/ as a visual reference until the new engine reached parity. It has
been removed. Frames and numbers it produced are kept as frozen test references in
reference/snapshots/zdog/ and packages/*/test/fixtures/zdog/.

